fect at what it does as a game can get.\"\nDestructoid – 10/10\n\n\"The game is a masterpiece.\"\nGiant Bomb – 5/5\n\n\"Limbo is genius. Freaky, weird genius. Disturbing, uncomfortable genius.\"\nThe Escapist – 5/5\n\n\"Dark, disturbing, yet eerily beautiful, Limbo is a world that deserves to be explored.\"\nJoystiq – 5/5\n\nWinner of more than 100 awards, including:\n\n- Best Downloadable (Gameinformer)\n- Best Puzzle Game (Gamespot)\n- The Best Indie Game (Kotaku)\n- Digital Game of the Year (GameReactor)\n- Best Horror Game (IGN)\n- Best Visual Arts (Game Developers Choice Awards)\n- Technical Excellence (Independent Games Festival)\n- Adventure Game of the Year (D.I.C.E. Awards)\n- Outstanding Achievement in Sound Design (D.I.C.E. Awards)","released":"2013-07-03","updated":"2026-03-05","icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/27/93/37/27933752-b38e-368a-c72f-ecab44dc2ccd/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-10-0-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg","age":"12+"},"android":null,"icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/27/93/37/27933752-b38e-368a-c72f-ecab44dc2ccd/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-10-0-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg","cat":"Games","rating":4.56,"ratings":2663,"mentions":1,"users":1,"threads":1,"hn_points":4,"hn_comments":4,"submissions":1,"self_n":0,"hn_score":6.64,"first":1372874746,"last":1372874746,"show_hn":null,"n_lab":1,"pos_pct":0,"neg_pct":0,"mood":null,"quotes":[{"id":5986377,"k":"ios:656951157","type":"story","by":"felipebueno","time":1372874746,"text":"","title":"LIMBO Game for iPhone and iPad","story_id":5986377,"story_title":"LIMBO Game for iPhone and iPad","story_score":4,"comments":4,"w":5.644,"u":0,"s":"neu","self":false}],"slug":"playdead-s-limbo"}